---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Tentang Politeknik Baja Tegal - Kampus Vokasi Terapan">
    
    <!-- Hero Section Premium -->
    <section class="relative pt-32 pb-24 lg:pt-36 lg:pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-slate-900">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
            <div class="absolute -top-[20%] -right-[10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] rounded-full bg-blue-600/20 blur-[120px]"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-[10%] -left-[10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] rounded-full bg-amber-500/15 blur-[100px]"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#3b82f6_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] opacity-10"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center z-10">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-4 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 border border-blue-400/30 font-semibold text-xs md:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-6 backdrop-blur-sm">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                Profil Perguruan Tinggi
            </span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                Tentang <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 via-cyan-300 to-amber-300">Politeknik Baja Tegal</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                Pendidikan tinggi vokasi yang berfokus mencetak sumber daya manusia kompeten, adaptif terhadap kemajuan teknologi, dan siap bersaing di dunia industri modern.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Content Area -->
    <main class="relative bg-slate-50 min-h-screen py-16 -mt-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            
            <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
            <nav class="flex text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                <ol class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3">
                    <li class="inline-flex items-center">
                        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"/></svg>
                            Beranda
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <div class="flex items-center">
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 mx-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                            <span class="text-slate-400">Profil</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li aria-current="page">
                        <div class="flex items-center">
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 mx-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                            <span class="text-slate-800 font-semibold">Tentang PBJT</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </nav>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
                
                <!-- Kolom Kiri: Narasi Utama & Program Studi (8 Kolom) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-10">
                    
                    <!-- Card Narasi Institusi -->
                    <article class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] border border-slate-100">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
                            <div class="w-2.5 h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 rounded-full"></div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Vokasi Berorientasi Industri</h2>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 text-lg leading-relaxed text-justify">
                            <p class="first-letter:text-5xl first-letter:font-extrabold first-letter:text-primary first-letter:mr-3 first-letter:float-left">
                                <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Politeknik Baja (Bhakti Praja) Tegal</strong> adalah institusi pendidikan tinggi vokasi yang berfokus pada pengembangan sumber daya manusia yang kompeten, terampil, dan siap bersaing di dunia industri. Sebagai perguruan tinggi berbasis vokasi, Politeknik Baja Tegal menawarkan program pendidikan yang mengutamakan keterampilan praktis dengan kurikulum yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan industri. Dengan tenaga pengajar profesional serta fasilitas laboratorium dan bengkel yang memadai, Politeknik Baja Tegal berkomitmen untuk mencetak lulusan yang memiliki kompetensi tinggi dan mampu beradaptasi dengan perkembangan teknologi.
                            </p>
                            
                            <p>
                                Didirikan dengan tujuan untuk mendukung kemajuan industri dan pembangunan daerah, <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Politeknik Baja Tegal</strong> memiliki berbagai program studi unggulan, seperti <strong class="text-blue-700 font-semibold">Teknik Informatika, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Otomotif, dan Teknik Elektronika Industri</strong>. Selain itu, kampus ini juga aktif dalam kegiatan penelitian terapan serta pengabdian kepada masyarakat guna memberikan kontribusi nyata bagi lingkungan sekitar. Dengan semangat inovasi dan profesionalisme, Politeknik Baja Tegal terus berupaya menjadi institusi pendidikan vokasi yang unggul dan berdaya saing, baik di tingkat nasional maupun internasional.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Card 4 Program Studi Unggulan -->
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-blue-950 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-48 h-48 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
                        
                        <div class="mb-8 relative z-10">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400">Pendidikan Terapan</span>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-1">Program Studi Unggulan</h3>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm mt-2">Empat jurusan siap kerja yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan riil sektor manufaktur dan industri digital.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 relative z-10">
                            <!-- TI -->
                            <a href="/d3-teknik-informatika" class="group bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center gap-4">
                                <img src="/image/logo-prodi/l-teknik-informatika.webp" alt="Informatika" class="w-12 h-12 object-contain shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" />
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">D3 Teknik Informatika</h4>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5">Lihat Kurikulum & RPS <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </a>

                            <!-- Mesin -->
                            <a href="/d3-teknik-mesin" class="group bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center gap-4">
                                <img src="/image/logo-prodi/l-teknik-mesin.webp" alt="Mesin" class="w-12 h-12 object-contain shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" />
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">D3 Teknik Mesin</h4>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5">Lihat Kurikulum & RPS <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </a>

                            <!-- Otomotif -->
                            <a href="/d3-teknik-otomotif" class="group bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center gap-4">
                                <img src="/image/logo-prodi/l-teknik-otomotif.webp" alt="Otomotif" class="w-12 h-12 object-contain shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" />
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">D3 Teknik Otomotif</h4>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5">Lihat Kurikulum & RPS <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </a>

                            <!-- Elektronika -->
                            <a href="/d3-teknik-elektronika-industri" class="group bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-5 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center gap-4">
                                <img src="/image/logo-prodi/l-teknik-elektronika.webp" alt="Elektronika" class="w-12 h-12 object-contain shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" onerror="this.src='/image/logo-ukm/logo-polbaja.png'"/>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">D3 Teknik Elektronika</h4>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1 mt-0.5">Lihat Kurikulum & RPS <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 3 Komitmen Utama -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base mb-1">Kurikulum Praktis</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Berfokus pada keterampilan terapan industri dan adaptasi teknologi terkini.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base mb-1">Lab & Bengkel Modern</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Dilengkapi fasilitas laboratorium komputer dan bengkel teknik yang memadai.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base mb-1">Riset & Pengabdian</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Berperan aktif mendukung pembangunan masyarakat daerah dan nasional.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <!-- Kolom Kanan: Sertifikat Akreditasi Institusi (4 Kolom) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-4">
                    <div class="sticky top-28 space-y-6">
                        
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-lg border border-slate-200 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
                            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-50 text-green-700 text-xs font-bold border border-green-200 mb-4">
                                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                                Status Akreditasi Resmi
                            </div>
                            
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Akreditasi Perguruan Tinggi</h3>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mb-6">Politeknik Baja Tegal</p>
                            
                            <!-- Box Sertifikat -->
                            <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 shadow-inner group cursor-pointer" onclick="window.open('/image/uploads/akreditasi-poltek.jpg', '_blank')">
                                <img 
                                    src="/image/uploads/akreditasi-poltek.jpg" 
                                    alt="Sertifikat Akreditasi Perguruan Tinggi" 
                                    class="w-full h-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
                                />
                                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/0 group-hover:bg-slate-900/30 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center">
                                    <span class="opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 bg-white text-slate-900 font-semibold text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7"/></svg>
                                        Perbesar Sertifikat
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 italic mt-3">&#8211; <em>Sertifikat Akreditasi Perguruan Tinggi</em></p>

                            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
                                <a href="/image/uploads/akreditasi-poltek.jpg" target="_blank" class="w-full py-3 px-4 bg-primary text-white rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md shadow-primary/20">
                                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg>
                                    Lihat Ukuran Penuh
                                </a>
                                <a href="/akreditasi" class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">
                                    Akreditasi Program Studi →
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

</MainLayout>
